<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-006" chapter-id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts" source-id="s-liangshu-006-jing-consorts-ws2311629">
  <p id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">敬皇帝，諱<persName id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p001:m0005" ref="s14_u6j_1ek">方智</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p001:m0009" ref="s14_u6j_1ek">慧相</persName>，小字<persName id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p001:m0014" ref="s14_u6j_1ek">法真</persName>，世祖第九子也。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">戊午，尊所生<persName id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p002:m0006" ref="a9e_rqu_2cb">夏貴妃</persName>爲皇太后。立妃<persName id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p002:m0016" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAFA">王氏</persName>爲皇后。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">陳王踐阼，奉帝爲江陰王，薨于外邸，時年十六，追諡<persName id="c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p003:m0024" ref="s14_u6j_1ek">敬皇帝</persName>。</p>
</text>
